{
  "sn35.150:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.150 ",
  "sn35.150:0.2": "15. The Old and the New ",
  "sn35.150:0.3": "A Practice Conducive to Extinguishment ",
  "sn35.150:1.1": "“Mendicants, I will teach you a practice that’s conducive to extinguishment. ",
  "sn35.150:1.2": "Listen … ",
  "sn35.150:1.3": "And what is that practice that’s conducive to extinguishment? ",
  "sn35.150:1.4": "What do you think, mendicants? ",
  "sn35.150:1.5": "Is the eye permanent or impermanent?” ",
  "sn35.150:2.1": "“Impermanent, sir.” ",
  "sn35.150:3.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, is it suffering or happiness?” ",
  "sn35.150:4.1": "“Suffering, sir.” ",
  "sn35.150:5.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, suffering, and perishable, is it fit to be regarded thus: ",
  "sn35.150:5.2": "‘This is mine, I am this, this is my self’?” ",
  "sn35.150:6.1": "“No, sir.” ",
  "sn35.150:7.1": "“Are sights … ",
  "sn35.150:8.1": "",
  "sn35.150:9.1": "eye consciousness … ",
  "sn35.150:9.2": "eye contact … ",
  "sn35.150:9.3": "The pleasant, painful, or neutral feeling that arises dependent on mind contact: is that permanent or impermanent?” ",
  "sn35.150:10.1": "“Impermanent, sir.” ",
  "sn35.150:11.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, is it suffering or happiness?” ",
  "sn35.150:12.1": "“Suffering, sir.” ",
  "sn35.150:13.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, suffering, and perishable, is it fit to be regarded thus: ",
  "sn35.150:13.2": "‘This is mine, I am this, this is my self’?” ",
 